[00:14.96] Well, I'm gonna pick you up in edna's old pickup truck
[00:14.96] 我会开着埃德娜的老旧皮卡来接你
[00:18.83] We'll head down the red river
[00:18.83] 我们沿红河顺流而下
[00:22.47] Throw us a line or two, catch us a brown or blue
[00:22.47] 抛出一两条钓线 钓条褐鳟或蓝鳃
[00:26.13] Get your wife a flathead dinner
[00:26.13] 给你妻子准备顿平头鱼的晚餐
[00:29.50] And innocent boys get meaner just when them trees get greener
[00:29.50] 无辜的男孩变得凶狠 就在树木转绿的时分
[00:33.34] Soon as you cross the state line
[00:33.34] 一旦你越过州界线
[00:35.78]
[00:37.74] So if they come lookin', tell 'em I'm on the run again
