[00:41.78] Chasin' the sun again, out of my mind
[00:41.78] 又在追逐太阳 神志不清醒
[00:45.49] They come lookin', tell them that I died again
[00:45.49] 他们来寻我 就说我又已死去
[00:49.18] Crossin' state lines again, wishin' I was home
[00:49.18] 又在穿越州界线 渴望回到家中
[00:52.45]
[01:03.13] Boys hang around the bend, watch when you're crossin' them
